--------------------------------------------------------------------------------

Not redistributed by this repository. The image build pulls IBM's public container
image `ibmcom/spectrum-symphony:7.3.2.0`, pinned by digest in `docker/Dockerfile`,
and copies the installed Symphony tree out of it.

That software is licensed by IBM under IBM's own terms, separately from this
repository's license, as the International License Agreement for Non-Warranted
Programs (Z125-5589-05). `LI_en.txt` inside the image names the program as
