Acceptance is explicit and has no default:

    docker build --build-arg ACCEPT_IBM_LICENSE=yes -f docker/Dockerfile -t symphony-akida .

Without that argument the build stops before contacting IBM's registry and prints
what it is asking you to agree to. The full license text ships inside the built
image at /licenses.

The Community Edition entitlement file the cluster uses comes from IBM's own
image. This repository supplies no license key.

