Ported source
--------------------------------------------------------------------------------

`src/common/tiled_shard.py` and `src/common/detection_map.py` are ports of
`akida_models.detection.tiled_inference` and `akida_models.detection.map_evaluation`
from the `akida_models` branch `feature/tiled-yolov2-r448`. `src/common/testkit.py`
reads the test kit format from the same source. All are BrainChip work, included
here under this repository's license.

