--------------------------------------------------------------------------------
Datasets
--------------------------------------------------------------------------------

The `.npz` sample sets under `data/` are derived from the sources below. Each
upstream source keeps its own terms; consult the upstream project before
redistributing derived data.

  data/speech_commands/
    Google Speech Commands, released by Google under the Creative Commons
    Attribution 4.0 International license (CC BY 4.0).
    https://ai.googleblog.com/2017/08/launching-speech-commands-dataset.html

  data/coco2014_96/
    Visual Wake Words, derived from the COCO 2014 dataset. COCO annotations are
    released under CC BY 4.0; the images are subject to the Flickr terms of use.
    https://cocodataset.org/#termsofuse

  data/voc2007/
    PASCAL VOC 2007 test split. The VOC data includes images obtained from Flickr,
    whose corresponding terms of use apply.
    http://host.robots.ox.ac.uk/pascal/VOC/voc2007/

  data/surface_search_classifier/
    Seeded uniform noise generated by this repository. Not real data, and every
    app that serves it says so.
